<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pasminco year net jumps to A$40.8 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pasminco year net jumps to A$40.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    71.0 vs 32.9</p>
<p>    Net				     40.8 vs 12.2</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     3.0 vs 2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Pasminco Ltd is a base metals miner and smelter operator.</p>
</text>
